~ jonathan
do ObjectiveManager.update_progress(1, 1)
Jonathan: Hey, Danilo!
Jonathan: [wave]I was going to call you yesterday, but you were too fast.[/wave]
Danilo: So... you were following me?
Jonathan: I wasn’t following you.
Jonathan: I just came back from town, I wanted to check on you.
Danilo: Sorry, I was... preoccupied.
Danilo: Did you see anyone going to the house earlier?
Jonathan: [wave]Nope.[/wave]
Jonathan: I was fishing with Mang Gino, just got back.
Danilo: Ah... I see. Thanks.
do can_interact = true
do player_danilo.force_cannot_move = false
do SignalBus.jonathan_done.emit("npc_jonathan")
do _check_objectives()
do SignalBus.asked_a_neighbor.emit()
=> END

